{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/12/24/8108176/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も朝から寒いですね(,,> <,,)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう6時なのに、まだ空は暗い..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなは朝起きて、温かい日本茶を飲んみました*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体が暖まる～(*˘︶˘*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は名古屋個別握手会♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中、ひなに会いに来て下さったみなさんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もう今年の握手は、今日で終わりなの～」っていうふぁみりーさんもいらっしゃって、寂しい～(   ´^`   )という思いと、感謝の気持ちと...色々だった＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、もう1年終わりか...あっという間だったなあとも感じたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2014年は、映画吹き替え、初選抜、舞台などたくさんの経験をさせて頂き、とても濃い1年でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、ひなを支えて下さったひなちまふぁみりーさん、ほんとうに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"み～んな大好きだよ(´๑•ω•๑`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでも...「まだ28日の京都個別握手会にも行くからね」っていうふぁみりーさんもたくさんで、嬉しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまってますね(*´˘`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、昨日来られなかったふぁみりーさんへ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、サンタさん風エプロンにくるくるハーフツインテール♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/12/24/8108176/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスは日奈がお料理を作ってパーティーの用意して、お仕事から帰ってきた旦那さんを迎えたいな...♡なんていう夢.｡.:*♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/12/24/8108176/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"28日の握手会や、30日の大感謝祭でお会いできると良いなあ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、陽菜へのLOVEが止まらない。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の空き時間にも、となりに座っている川後のひなさんに、「ねぇ～陽菜～♡」「陽菜LOVE～♡」って言いながら抱きついていたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも川後のひなさんは、「なに(´･ω･`)？」っていうツンな反応だったのだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3回に1回くらい、抱き返してくれるというツンデレ具合...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがまた好き。笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/12/24/8108176/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragrap